error: cannot tell what an empty `[]` is a list of
  --> 001_empty_list_literal.kira:7:14
    7 |     var xs = []
      |              ^^ element type is unknown here
  help: Nothing here says what this list holds: it has no elements to read a type from, and the element type is not inferred from a later `push`. Annotate the binding — `var xs: list[int32] = []` — or start the list with the elements it should hold.

